OL,3,AIrish star CMAT joins Philomena Begley
OL,4,Aon stage in surprise appearance
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish star CMAT made a surprise
OL,7,Fappearance at an award ceremony in
OL,8,FBelfast on Wednesday.
OL,10,FThe world-renowned pop-star joined
OL,11,FPhilomena Begley, one of Irish country
OL,12,Fmusic's most loved and celebrated
OL,13,Fentertainers, on stage at the NI Music
OL,14,FPrize.
OL,16,FBegley was honoured with the Lifetime
OL,17,FAchievement Award in recognition of her
OL,18,F64-year career.
OL,20,FThe country music legend performed the
OL,21,Fhit Blanket on the Ground alongside
OL,22,FCMAT.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
